{"unit_id":"zhang66633__dsh-pixel-ui#readme-10","repo":"zhang66633/dsh-pixel-ui","commit":"ebbbec1ae661a69a9b85b00a2a53234219ad62a6","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pixel-ui README · 使用：1. 首次安装默认激活「像素·木屋」；之后恢复上次选择。\n2. **设置 → 通用设置 → 像素主题**，十个按钮切换九套皮肤或「现代默认」。\n3. 选「现代默认」即整体退出；选择会记住，刷新/重启不复活。\n\n主题偏好位于 `$DSH_HOME/storages/dsh-pixel-ui/preference.json`，浏览器 localStorage 只做同端口镜像。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"zhang66633__dsh-pixel-ui#readme-11","repo":"zhang66633/dsh-pixel-ui","commit":"ebbbec1ae661a69a9b85b00a2a53234219ad62a6","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pixel-ui README · 兼容：- **DSH**：目标 `0.2.1-rc.5`（真实宿主九套验证）；声明范围 `0.1.0-rc.6` ~ `0.2.x`，`engines.dsh` / dsh peers / `dshReleases` 三处一致。\n- **DSH Desktop**：2.0.x，web 兼容模式/高级模式均可。\n- **浏览器**：现代 Chromium / Firefox；CSS 变量 + SVG 光标 + 本地字体。\n- **无障碍**：九主题全部通过 WCAG AA；`prefers-reduced-motion` 下关闭动效。","source":"extracted","section":"兼容"}
